{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/2658eef7c13f9a5265d91bc0360315f3.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/2658eef7c13f9a5265d91bc0360315f3.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standby for instructions from the Unknown Research Consortium (U.R.C.), where conducting reconnaissance missions across Dimensional Fragments is crucial to securing remnants of human presence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie interdimensional worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unconventional parts to construct a rich variety of custom weapons using the expansive Corruption System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the atmospheric landscape for rare resources to upgrade your arsenal and home base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay supernatural abominations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/ab10d8594b18c91c65fe80d40a1cc5f2.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/ab10d8594b18c91c65fe80d40a1cc5f2.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only severe ecological catastrophes or disastrous supernatural events could have resulted in the return of Dimensional Fragments. Slay chilling warped creatures as the world decays around you, and remember to uphold the number one rule: <strong>Survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/4cad5eae12eb9fddd9bdf5e900b0bb59.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/4cad5eae12eb9fddd9bdf5e900b0bb59.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise, adapt, and overcome when faced with obscene obstacles in the Dimensional Fragments. Forge the unthinkable. Combine a motorcycle silencer with a rifle barrel, or a Victorian-era brass sight with a modern carbine to concoct masterpieces of devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/22a565aa9b3d788975dd828a27f9939d.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/22a565aa9b3d788975dd828a27f9939d.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCompatibility\u201d is a dead concept when navigating Dimensional Fragments. Load corrupted rifle ammo into compact pistols, and watch as violet fissures erupt from its surface. It is no longer a tool, but a weapon that laughs in the face of ballistic norms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/0a170cd2910404108eb92dd5e6626489.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/0a170cd2910404108eb92dd5e6626489.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Dimensional Fragments as they decay for reasons beyond human comprehension. Scour derelict outposts and abandoned research facilities for vital resources and long-lost relics of the past. Extract before the window closes. <strong>The clock is ticking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/96bd74e6978bc83d09687403d6bbe79b.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/96bd74e6978bc83d09687403d6bbe79b.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t face the horrors that lie ahead alone. Stay up-to-date with commanders, co-workers, and field agents by keeping up on emails and messages. Execute each objective they assign, and uncover more secrets through encrypted logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/3fc2737734241158040a8df1192d2c5f.poster.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/3fc2737734241158040a8df1192d2c5f.webm?t=1770890691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent\u2019s training is never truly complete. Sharpen skills and other abilities to prepare for future calamities, and outgrow your previous self in the lawless void ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Our deepest gratitude goes to you and your unit for your extraordinary contributions to humanity\u2019s survival and research endeavors. Your valor etches hope into the fabric of our future.</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i><strong>\u2014U.R.C. Joint Committee</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/extras/cefc4c92e76f58b8d17448a5617f955f.avif?t=1770890691\" width=616 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong> </strong></i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299050?t=1770890691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/830ad38d5ba6426151b4a4eecc70d09a9f4b9a74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770890691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/3e2925780b2522a2a1386a85227c7d5b2e6abdea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770890691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299050/3e2925780b2522a2a1386a85227c7d5b2e6abdea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770890691","categories":[{"description":"Singl